# What never goes up with a deployment.
#
# `.gitignore` already lists most of this, and the CLI does read it — but not
# reliably enough: a `vercel --prod` failed with "File size limit exceeded
# (100 MB)" on a 246 MB Turbopack cache file sitting in `.next/dev/cache`, which
# `.gitignore` covers. This file is the mechanism Vercel documents for the job,
# so the answer is to say it here rather than to hope.
#
# Everything below is either rebuilt on the server or exists only on the machine
# that runs the ingestion scripts.

# Build output and dev caches — the server runs its own build.
.next
out
build

# Local ingestion artifacts: council meeting audio, agenda PDFs, transcripts.
# Hundreds of megabytes, regenerated by scripts/ingest.
data

# The Python virtualenv for local transcription. Carries CUDA libraries, one of
# which is 637 MB on its own.
.venv-asr

node_modules
.git
dev.log
